// The Town Map of Paldea (plan 34 · PD3's second session; docs/data-files.md, "The region map"): an open region's
// map, painted from above out of its bake (plan 32 · OW10), a cell for each 32-metre chunk of its land's bounds, so its
// 46 by 38 cells run from the baked chunk -25,-36 at the north-west. The blocks are the areas built so far, on the cells
// whose middles their polygons hold (world.json); every word is ours. Fly lands on a marker of the places' files:
// before the player's door in Cabo Poco and before each town's Pokémon Center, once the town has been come to (its
// first arrival's flag, which crossing into the open area sets). PaldeaTests holds the grid and the cells to the bake.
// Plan 34 · PD6 widened it west for the West Province and wrote it again from world.json and the bake; its second
// session grew it north for the North Province and Glaseado Mountain and wrote it again the same way.
